# (0.23) The Desktop: print notices, the folder disk, Run in Atari (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py
# makes tests/desk23.keys from this; the card gets tests/mk23.py's additions: a clock, /Atari,
# /Desktop/PROG.BAS, /HELLO.LST; emu816 --classic-print tests/p23.atascii@6: the classic
# Atari prints at 6 s, the job is finished 3 s later; (0.31) the classic Atari is shown from
# 5 s to 9.5 s (F12): the Desktop looks at the print jobs when it comes back, not on a
# timer; the PC icon is always there: PROG.BAS is a row lower). Files is at (24, 24); its rows:
# HELLO.LST y 181, README.TXT 205 ((0.25) Files reads / again when it comes to the front: the
# /Printouts folder the first job made shows, one row above them). Shots (s):
#   1  10.5  the notice "Printed: Atari" (the job finished at 9 s) instead of the clock
#   2  13.0  the notice clicked: Printer with the job
#   3  16.0  the Atari icon clicked: the panel, "Folder disk..." and "No folder disk" at its bottom
#   4  18.0  Folder disk...: the dialog (/Atari, D2:)
#   5  20.5  Enter (Mount): D2: "/Atari (folder)" with Refresh, "5 files, 4 left out, 543 free
#            sectors" (tests/mk23.py); Refresh clicked (mounted again: tests/desk23.err)
#   6  23.0  the Atari icon's menu: "Eject D2: Atari", "Folder disk..." in the last group
#   7  26.5  the panel closed; PROG.BAS's menu: Open, Run in Atari, -, Rename..., Delete
#   8  32.3  Run in Atari (kind 4), F12; the panel: Program PROG.BAS
#   9  35.0  README.TXT's menu in Files: ... Print
#  10  37.5  Print: Files' footer "Printed ...", the notice "Printed: Files"
#  11  39.5  HELLO.LST's menu: ... Print, Run in Atari (then chosen: kind 4, F12)
# the notice clicked: Printer (the classic Atari's job selected); Esc closes it
